# Base URL of the LedgerGuard API.
#
# Set it to talk directly to a deployed backend:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://ledgerguard.duvalkwali.tech
#
# Leave it unset (or empty) to issue same-origin requests, which the Vite dev server
# proxies to http://localhost:8080 — the default for running against a local backend.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and edit. Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed variables
# to client code, and the value is baked in at build time, so restart `npm run dev`
# after changing it.
VITE_API_URL=
